Lenscript is a teleprompter with a built-in camera: it scrolls a script you write
or paste so that you can read it while speaking, it can record you — video with
sound, video only, or sound only — while the words scroll, and it keeps the takes
you choose to keep next to their script on your device. It is a tool on your
device, not a social network and not a publishing service. There are no accounts,
and no one else can see your scripts or your recordings.

The quality of a recording — resolution, frame rate, sound, light — depends on
